{"about_the_game":"In this turn\u2011based word\u2011puzzle adventure, you are a Dragon Riddler: an adventurer seeking fabled dragon gold.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJourney through a fantasy land where words hold power and reality is scattered into mythic Regions. Each Region is guarded by a powerful foe, protected by magical Gates, and patrolled by monsters and ruffians of all kinds. As you fight your way forward, every Gate you open reveals a prophecy describing the possible breed of the final dragon. The prophecy is hazy at first but becomes clearer as you progress. Each dragon breed has its own strengths and weaknesses, so prepare wisely.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBoth the combat and magic systems rely on a word\u2011based mechanic that creates synergy between the adventurer\u2019s abilities and the player\u2019s skill, with a healthy dose of luck and mastery. By choosing the right combat stance, you can shift between defensive, balanced and aggressive styles, and a Blackjack\u2011like preparation phase plays a crucial role in breaking the magical Gate seals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImprove your adventurer by earning XP for building strong words and spending it on various boons. Your foes come with their own buffs, debuffs, and traits, and circumstances may trigger both beneficial and harmful effects on the hero.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576600?t=1768831225","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576600/c7bf8ddf0cd4b1233b20020b12737490f062bd39/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768831225","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576600/d1619c259bd323c1d07dfd57fcd31b6186638ec2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768831225","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576600/d1619c259bd323c1d07dfd57fcd31b6186638ec2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768831225","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family S